{"product_id":"such-a-fun-age","title":"Such a Fun Age","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn the midst of a family crisis one late evening, white blogger Alix Chamberlain calls her African American babysitter, Emira, asking her to take toddler Briar to the local market for distraction. There, the security guard accuses Emira of kidnapping Briar, and Alix's efforts to right the situation turn out to be good intentions selfishly mismanaged.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 131 x 200\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Reid Kiley\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781526612168\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 310\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45262387347609,"sku":"13RB9781526612168","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67ea75e317bb3_Such_20a_20Fun_20Age_20Reid_20Kiley.jpg?v=1743436788","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/such-a-fun-age","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}